{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop Trains is a cozy pixel-art railway simulator where you build railroads, manage trains, and collect rare locomotives with unique designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude82 Manage Your Railway</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send trains from one point to another across a detailed pixel map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan routes and watch your trains move in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee4\ufe0f Buy and Customize Trains</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase new locomotives and wagons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your train sets to suit different tasks and missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Build and Expand</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and upgrade stations to unlock new routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your infrastructure to handle growing traffic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf08 Unlock Rare Trains</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect unique trains with bright and unusual paint jobs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenges to unlock special models.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 Transport Cargo and Passengers </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money by delivering goods and passengers between stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2160270?t=1765229191","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2160270/98a01d630cb860f1457db1b5f9e48c3346da4bd9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765229191","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2160270/0922bd796fe9efa75795b57483d87bb6cdaa466d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765229191","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2160270/0922bd796fe9efa75795b57483d87bb6cdaa466d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765229191","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop Trains is a cozy pixel-art railway simulator where you build railroads, manage trains, and collect rare locomotives with unique designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude82 Manage Your Railway</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send trains from one point to another across a detailed pixel map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan routes and watch your trains move in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee4\ufe0f Buy and Customize Trains</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase new locomotives and wagons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your train sets to suit different tasks and missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Build and Expand</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and upgrade stations to unlock new routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your infrastructure to handle growing traffic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf08 Unlock Rare Trains</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect unique trains with bright and unusual paint jobs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenges to unlock special models.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 Transport Cargo and Passengers </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money by delivering goods and passengers between stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Clirgo Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it